error[V0307]: `name` is another name for part of `user`, so `user` cannot be changed until `name` is no longer needed
  --> crates/varyk/tests/fixtures/errors/v0307_argument_changed_while_result_used/main.vr:18:5
   |
18 |     user.rename("Bo");
   |     ^^^^ `name` is another name for part of `user`, so `user` cannot be changed until `name` is no longer needed
19 |     println!("{}", name);
   |                    ---- `name` is used here later
   |
   = note: in Rust terms, `name` is a reference that borrows `user`, and a value cannot be changed while it is borrowed
